6. index.md card 3: 'a loop would need 2^E to sit absurdly close to 3^S'
==============================================================================
  cycle: prod over odd elements (3 + 1/n_i) = 2^E  =>  0 < E ln2 - S ln3 < S/(3 n_min).
  With n_min > 2^68 (verified range):  2^E/3^S - 1 < S / (3 * 2^68) = S * 1.129e-21

